    whatChanged: `Unchanged from KBLI 2020 — direct match.`,
    baliContext: `Bali is a major global garment export hub — wholesale buyers from Australia, Europe, and the US come to Seminyak and Kuta for bulk orders. The Made in Bali fashion label carries genuine market value in sustainable fashion circles. SNI labeling requirements apply for garments sold domestically. Export garments need a Surat Keterangan Asal (certificate of origin) from the local trade office for preferential tariff access.`,
